        "title": "The table describes the changes of people who went for international travel in 1990, 1995, 2000 and 2005 (in millions). Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The table describes the changes of people who went for international travel in 1990, 1995, 2000 and 2005 (in millions). Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - International tourist arrivals: 1990&ndash;2005</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcAqdmlrvo9YfQxQ8txlkhjdgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>International tourist arrivals: 1990&ndash;2005</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về số lượng du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế đến năm khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau v&agrave;o bốn năm: 1990, 1995, 2000 v&agrave; 2005.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRiCdhn6DoEFZYxcYWalJ3Kbgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề <em>International tourist arrivals: 1990&ndash;2005</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: lượng du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế - năm khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau - bốn năm: 1990, 1995, 2000 v&agrave; 2005.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUCbdIJLNoa83HxibjUl3jeugxc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfZdZ3hhoHVmbxF3jDlUvmdgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>tổng số du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế tăng, với hầu hết c&aacute;c khu vực đều ghi nhận xu hướng tăng, ngoại trừ America giảm nhẹ v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AxdQdjWOootDHvxmAShlH0fdg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Europe lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; lượng du kh&aacute;ch cao nhất trong suốt giai đoạn, trong khi Asia and the Pacific ghi nhận mức tăng trưởng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oo2UdJWyfogutexlC8Dlib9Vgae\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Europe, America v&agrave; Asia and the Pacific</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIordh8JDosEIYx1KpdlG6Bhgwe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Europe dẫn đầu với 280.2 triệu, cao gấp khoảng 3.5 lần America ở mức 80.5 triệu, c&ograve;n Asia and the Pacific ghi nhận 60.2 triệu)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRqtdjaUboCzZ9xO94floozUgWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Europe v&agrave; America </strong><em>(Europe tăng ổn định l&ecirc;n 400.2 triệu v&agrave;o năm 2005, duy tr&igrave; vị tr&iacute; dẫn đầu, trong khi đ&oacute; America tăng l&ecirc;n đỉnh điểm 118.2 triệu v&agrave;o năm 2000, sau đ&oacute; giảm nhẹ xuống 113.2 triệu v&agrave;o năm 2005).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwTMdgvHaoTB5Ux9wuAltoUYg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Asia and the Pacific </strong><em>(tăng hơn gấp đ&ocirc;i, đạt 135.8 triệu v&agrave;o năm 2005, từ đ&oacute; vượt mặt America)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQRsdAy1tor0z6xpumhlnvFNgeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Africa v&agrave; Middle East</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fvhed7nhSoM7J9xQ4K2lNdClgth\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Africa c&oacute; 18.2 triệu du kh&aacute;ch, gần gấp đ&ocirc;i Middle East ở mức 9.8 triệu)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0tndI50koRSBPxoNTblbN7igCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Africa v&agrave; Middle East </strong><em>(cả 2 tăng ổn định, với Africa đạt 28.7 triệu c&ograve;n Middle East đạt 15.8 triệu đến năm 2005, tương đương mức tăng lần lượt l&agrave; 10.5 triệu v&agrave; 6 triệu)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULeBdpxNfowzy4xT48xldjB9gjb\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>số</strong> <strong>lượng du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEYfdxwruonWE6xkitJlrRsWgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OppHdle8ooNDf8xMsHRlZ4EVgwb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OppHdle8ooNDf8xMsHRlZ4EVgwb\">the number of international tourists</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIRxdZGqHopBxaxpIwpl67tkgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UXOcdZIIdoze4SxYmpIlaVXBgkc\">global tourist numbers</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn2Udq05AoSDbQxU5omlCJnOgAf\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UHlhd4sxeogKoFxRtKslTBMGgFg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OppHdle8ooNDf8xMsHRlZ4EVgwb\">The table illustrates <strong>the number of international tourists</strong>, measured in millions, who traveled to five different regions worldwide in 1990, 1995, 2000 and 2005.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bjr4dxe9VoVCQbxyhvblI4Q5g5f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UXOcdZIIdoze4SxYmpIlaVXBgkc\">Overall, <strong>global tourist numbers</strong> rose significantly over the 15-year period, with all regions experiencing growth except America, which saw a slight decline towards the end.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2760,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The table illustrates the number of international tourists, measured in millions, who traveled to five different regions worldwide in 1990, 1995, 2000 and 2005.</p>",
            "question_id": 36034,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2761,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, global tourist numbers rose significantly over the 15-year period, with all regions experiencing growth except America, which saw a slight decline towards the end. Additionally, Europe consistently attracted the highest number of visitors, while Asia and the Pacific recorded the most significant increase.</p>",
            "question_id": 36034,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2762,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the most popular destinations, Europe dominated with 280.2 million arrivals in 1990, approximately 3.5 times higher than America at 80.5 million, while Asia and the Pacific stood at 60.2 million. By 2005, Europe's figure had risen steadily to 400.2 million, maintaining its leading position. Meanwhile, America's numbers increased to a peak of 118.2 million in 2000 before falling slightly to 113.2 million at the end of the period. In contrast, Asia and the Pacific witnessed remarkable growth, more than doubling to reach 135.8 million in 2005, thereby surpassing America.</p>",
            "question_id": 36034,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2763,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for the remaining regions, Africa recorded 18.2 million tourists in 1990, nearly double that of the Middle East at 9.8 million. Both regions followed a consistent upward trend throughout the period, with Africa's figure rising to 28.7 million and the Middle East reaching 15.8 million by 2005, representing increases of approximately 10.5 and 6 million, respectively.</p>",
            "question_id": 36034,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
